            </note>
            <note corresp="#d40-f2" n="2" xml:id="d40-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d39">Document 39</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d40-f3" n="3" xml:id="d40-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to two first-page stories in <hi rendition="#italic">The New York
                        Times</hi> by Beecher, one headlined: “Administration Gets Study Of Global
                    Nuclear Strategy,” May 1, and the other headlined “Hints of Reprisal Shield U.S.
                    Planes,” May 4.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
